WEBVTT

00:05:57.375 --> 00:06:00.184
I want to see more kindness in the world.

00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:01.726
Is that kindness --

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.518
is that value in the result

00:06:04.542 --> 00:06:06.125
or is it in the doing?

00:06:07.042 --> 00:06:10.667
Are you trying to be kind
when it's hard to be kind?

00:06:11.875 --> 00:06:14.684
Can you do something
you don't want to do kindly,

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:16.684
like fire someone?

00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:19.268
Can you leave
a relationship with kindness?

00:06:19.292 --> 00:06:22.143
If kindness is the value,

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:25.434
then are you trying to express it

00:06:25.458 --> 00:06:28.268
in the whole spectrum of your doing --

00:06:28.292 --> 00:06:31.042
and trying to do that?